    <name>
      <text>POPULATION PROJECTION_q1</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="moodle_auto_format">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Given the following female population of Trindad in \(1960\) and \(1975\), study it and answer the questions that follow. </p>
<p>
<table border="solid">
  <tr>
    <th width="15%", style="text-align:center">Age</th>
    <th width="15%", style="text-align:center">\(1960\)</th>
    <th width="15%", style="text-align:center">\(1975\)</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
  <td style="text-align:center">\(0-14\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">\({@ageset_1a@}\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">\({@ageset_1b@}\)</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="text-align:center">\(15-29\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">\({@ageset_2a@}\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">\({@ageset_2b@}\)</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="text-align:center">\(30-44\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">\({@ageset_3a@}\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">\({@ageset_3b@}\)</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="text-align:center">\(45-59\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">\({@ageset_4a@}\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">\({@ageset_4b@}\)</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="text-align:center">60+</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">\({@ageset_5a@}\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">\({@ageset_5b@}\)</td>
  </tr>
</table>
</p>

<p>Note: Leave your answer correct to \(3\) dp</p>
<p>Determine the growth rates over the given years denoted as \(\text{p}\)</p>
<p>\(\begin{bmatrix}
f_1 &f_2  & f_3 & 0 & 0\\ 
p_1 & 0 & 0 & 0 &0 \\ 
0 & p_2 & 0 &0  &0 \\ 
 0& 0 & p_3 & 0 & 0\\ 
0 & 0 &0  & p_4 & p_5
\end{bmatrix}\begin{bmatrix}
v(1,t)\\ 
v(2,t)\\ 
v(3,t)\\ 
v(4,t)\\ 
v(5,t)
\end{bmatrix}\)</p>
<p>\(\text{p}_1=\) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]][[feedback:prt1]]</p>
<p>\(\text{p}_2=\) [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]][[feedback:prt2]]</p>
<p>\(\text{p}_3=\) [[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]][[feedback:prt3]]</p>
<p>\(\text{p}_4=\) [[input:ans4]] [[validation:ans4]][[feedback:prt4]]</p>
<p>\(\text{p}_5=\) [[input:ans5]] [[validation:ans5]][[feedback:prt5]]</p>
<br>
<p>Using the growth rate above, project the population from \(1975-1990\)</p>
<table border="solid">
  <tr>
    <th width="15%", style="text-align:center">Age</th>
    <th width="15%", style="text-align:center">\(1975\)</th>
<th width="15%", style="text-align:center">\(1990\)</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
  <td style="text-align:center">\(0-14\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">\({@ageset_1b@}\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">[[input:ans6]] [[validation:ans6]][[feedback:prt6]]</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="text-align:center">\(15-29\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">\({@ageset_2b@}\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">[[input:ans7]] [[validation:ans7]][[feedback:prt7]]</td>
  </tr>
<tr>
    <td style="text-align:center">\(30-44\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">\({@ageset_3b@}\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">[[input:ans8]] [[validation:ans8]][[feedback:prt8]]</td>
  </tr>
<tr>
    <td style="text-align:center">\(44-59\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">\({@ageset_4b@}\)</td>
    <td style="text-align:center">[[input:ans9]] [[validation:ans9]][[feedback:prt9]]</td>
  </tr>
<tr>
